  "Enable biometric authentication": "启用生物识别身份验证",
  "Still remember your passphrase? Use passphrase to login this time.": "还记得你的密码吗？ 这次使用密码登录。",
  "No biometrics found. Go to your device settings to enroll your biometric.": "未找到生物特征。转到您的设备设置以注册您的生物特征。",
  "Users are advised to assess their threat perception before enabling biometric authentication. Don't enable this if you're storing state secrets! Visit FAQs for more information.": "建议用户在启用生物识别身份验证之前评估其威胁感知。如果您存储国家机密，请不要启用此功能！访问常见问题了解更多信息。",
  "No route: {route}": "没有路线: {route}",
  "Can't decrypt without phrase!": "没有密码口令无法解密！",
  "{argsType}, Needed for route: {route}": "{argsType}, 路线需要: {route}",
  "Do you want to import {noOfNotesInImport} new notes?": "你要导入 {noOfNotesInImport} 新笔记吗?",
  "There is no way to decrypt these notes without the passphrase. With great security comes the great responsibility of remembering the passphrase!": "没有密码是无法解密这些笔记的。因为有了极大的安全性，那也就有了记住密码口令的重大责任!",
  "If the Notes in your backup file was encrypted with different passphrase then you'll be prompted to enter the passphrase of the device that generated backup.": "如果备份文件中的笔记使用不同的密码口令加密，则会提示您输入生成备份的设备的密码口令.",
  "When turned on, the content on the screen is treated as secure, blocking background snapshots and preventing it from appearing in screenshots or from being viewed on non-secure displays.": "当开启时，将阻止屏幕截图和在非安全显示上被查看。",
  "Note: on Android 13 and above, for privacy the recent-tasks thumbnail is always hidden even when this is off.": "注意：Android 13 及以上，最近任务里的应用缩略图始终不会显示。",
  "Passphrase is similar to password but generally longer, it will be used to encrypt and decrypt your notes. Use strong passphrase and make sure to remember it. It is impossible to decrypt your notes without the passphrase. With great security comes the great responsibility of remembering the passphrase!": "密码口令类似于密码，但通常更长，将用于加密和解密您的笔记。使用强密码并确保记住它，没有密码就不可能解密你的笔记。伴随着极大安全性而来的是记住密码的重大责任！",
  "AppBackupDescription": "这将创建一个加密的本地备份，该备份每天都会自动更新。 此外，备份的设计使其可以与其他开源工具（如SyncThing）一起使用，以在本地网络上的不同设备上保留多个冗余备份。\n要切换到新设备，您只需复制此备份文件到新设备并将其导入新的CarroNote App。\n有关详细信息，请参阅常见问题解答。",
